# SpendWise Dashboard

## Project Description
SpendWise Dashboard is a responsive personal finance dashboard built using HTML and CSS. It provides a simple layout for viewing monthly spending across different financial categories.

## Features
- Sidebar navigation menu.
- Dashboard header with user profile.
- Six financial category cards:
  - Food
  - Transport
  - Rent
  - Entertainment
  - Savings
  - Utilities
- Responsive layout for smaller screens.
- Dark theme support.
- Hover effects and smooth transitions.

## Technologies Used
- HTML5
- CSS3
- CSS Grid
- Flexbox
- CSS Custom Properties (Variables)
- Media Queries

## CSS Concepts Applied
- CSS Grid for the main dashboard layout and category cards.
- Flexbox for the sidebar, header, and individual cards.
- CSS variables for consistent colors and theming.
- Media queries for responsive design.
- Transitions and transforms for hover interactions.

